sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Manager as "Manager/HR"
    participant View as "Web View (manager.shift-swap-approvals.index)"
    participant Controller as "ShiftSwapApprovalController"
    participant Model as "ShiftSwapRequest Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Manager->>View: Buka halaman Persetujuan Tukar Shift
    View->>Controller: GET /manager/shift-swap-approvals
    Controller->>Model: Build filter (status, requester, date range)
    Model->>DB: SELECT shift_swap_requests + relasi requester/target/shift
    DB-->>Model: Dataset + pagination
    Model-->>Controller: Data permintaan tukar shift

    alt Data valid (query berhasil)
        Controller->>View: Render tabel + statistik + filter
        View-->>Manager: Daftar tukar shift tampil
    else Data tidak valid (query gagal)
        Controller->>View: Redirect back + flash error
        View-->>Manager: Notifikasi gagal memuat data
    end
